ife, mortgage and income protection, and business overloads. It also offers business banking solutions, such as trade and debtor, asset and leverage, structured property, technology asset, supply chain, and medical practice financing services, as well as financing for corporate and private equity firms. In addition, the company provides the company provides advisory; treasury and risk management for foreign exchange, commodities, interest rates, liquidity management, and equity structuring; fixed-income instruments; execution and custody solutions for institutions, hedge funds, corporates, and intermediaries; securities lending; and clearing services. Investec Group was founded in 1974 and is based in Sandton, South Africa.","employees":7777,"website":"https://www.investec.com","country":"South Africa","city":"Sandton","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Fani  Titi B.Sc., BSc (Hons), M.A., M.B.A.","title":"Group CEO & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Nishlan Andre Samujh BAcc, CA(SA), Dip (Tax)","title":"Group Finance Director, CFO & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Cumeshan Jayaseelan Moodliar BA, LLB, LLM (Tax)","title":"Business Head of Specialist Banking"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":8.879,"tpe":12.71,"ps":2.17,"pfcf":10.77,"peg":null,"pb":175.9,"rev_growth":0.0825,"eps_growth":0.108,"eps_growth_fwd":0.055,"eps_growth_next":0.1149,"div_yield":0.0612,"roe":0.1841,"roa":0.01337,"de":18.85,"gross_margin":0.2094,"op_margin":0.3545,"profit_margin":0.1643,"current_ratio":1.097},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":6.182,"sector":8.879,"score":1,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":7.532,"sector":12.71,"score":1,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.749,"sector":2.17,"score":0,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":10.77,"score":null,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":null,"score":null,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":93.94,"sector":175.9,